+\[
+  M_t-M_{u_n}\longrightarrow M_t-M_{t-}=J_t .
+\]
+Taking norms preserves convergence.  Since the closed interval
+\((-\infty,2C]\) is closed in \(\mathbb R\), the limit also satisfies
+\(\|J_t\|\le 2C\).
