+\begin{proof}
+This is the convenient named wrapper used by later arguments.  It is exactly
+Lemma~\ref{lem:Martingale.integral_increment_mul_increment_eq_zero} with the
+product-integrability hypothesis kept explicit.
+\end{proof}
